
=============
TCLTK-8.6.17/
=============

itk4.2.7/itkBase.c
    applied patch for MacOS tcl path as detailed in 
        https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1105506
    fixed 'not found' error from "package require Itk" in skycat

blt2.4/configre.in
blt2.4/src/Makefile
    replaced "-O6' with '-O3', added '-w' to CFLAGS to supress warnings
        about missing prototype decls

blt2.4/src/bltNsUtil.h
    proto decl changes to match tclDecls.h for v8.6.17

blt2.4/src/bltVecMath.c
blt2.4/src/bltScrollbar.c
    changed to use "Tcl_GetStringResult(interp)" for "interp->result"

blt2.4/src/bltTed.c
    used Tcl_SetObjResult() to set result string

blt2.4/src/bltCanvEps.c
    type cast to Tk_CanvasTagsParseProc

blt2.4/src/bltTreeViewStyle.c
    ansi decl for Blt_TreeViewTextbox()

blt2.4/src/tkButton.c
    Replaced the obsolete TkCopyAndGlobalEval() code


